      "Boat runs hold a shared fairshare lease so every repo on the PC keeps to two boat machines; machines are named to fairshare so ones left by killed runs still count. Root cause: check-then-start let three machines run at once on 2026-11-07, since a machine is missing from boat list while it is created.",
      "Bolas, and every weapon hit is a dose list",
      "Summon the Broodmother, beat her and make brood greaves round her trophy",
