      "grass blades masked to nothing no longer leave flat slivers on bare ground",
      "the reference rigid-body tree can snapshot and restore its state",
      "the Magic Formula tyre rolling backward now mirrors the slip, so friction opposes sliding in reverse (a parked car used to creep)",
      "the dev runner served .svg files as octet-stream, so SVG masks and images from a game's public folder did not draw",
